          "id": "n63-tblock",
          "type": "tblock",
          "x": 863.197790393508,
          "y": 1587.809412080345,
          "z": 106,
          "text": "Users have access to a beautifully designed code editor that supports code completion and syntax highlighting. Users can download their code as a full Figma plugin which they can run locally.",
          "w": 600,
          "h": 144.47426606050203,
          "fontSize": 16,
          "font": "sans",
          "pad": 16,
          "bg": "var(--cv-ui-bg)"
        },
        {
          "id": "n64-tblock",
          "type": "tblock",
          "x": 1972.3917159749997,
          "y": 1587.809412080345,
          "z": 107,
          "text": "Once users have gotten comfortable with the Figma developer API they can publish their creations to the Figlet community. From here users can star other users' figlets and use them in their own files. ",
          "w": 600,
          "h": 144.47426606050203,
          "fontSize": 16,
          "font": "sans",
          "pad": 16,
          "bg": "var(--cv-ui-bg)"
        },
        {
          "id": "n65-tblock",
          "type": "tblock",
          "x": 3023.3690891801502,
          "y": 1564.7110036072502,
          "z": 108,
          "text": "Figlet includes an interactive tutorial where it shows users example scenarios for them to complete and encourages them to practice solving the problems. Users can click the \"Show me\" button to see the finished solution.",
